  "hero_summary_zh": "太阳一旦下山，暗夜魔王的狩猎就会开始。他冲过暗影斑驳的丛林，在缓速的虚空中捕获猎物，将他们撕成碎片。如果日出威胁到了他的笼罩，他还能使天空暗淡，延长他的袭击。",
  "hero_summary_en": "Once the sun goes down, Night Stalker's hunt begins. Charging through the shadowy forests, he snares prey in a slowing void as he tears them to shreds. Should sunrise threaten to end his terror, he can darken the skies to extend his onslaught.",
